1","content":"\\[1.0.0] — 2024-01-01"},"9":{"id":"/en/changelog-7","page_id":"/en/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/changelog#added-2","content":"Added"},"10":{"id":"/en/changelog-8","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added","content":"**`SaveDataAsync(T data)`** — Async save method using `File.WriteAllBytesAsync`. Prevents blocking the main thread during file I/O."},"11":{"id":"/en/changelog-9","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added","content":"**`LoadDataAsync()`** — Async load method. Avoids frame drops on large save files or slow storage (especially mobile)."},"12":{"id":"/en/changelog-10","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added","content":"**`HasSaveData()`** — Check whether a save file exists before attempting to load. Previously, you had to call `LoadData()` and check for `null`."},"13":{"id":"/en/changelog-11","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#fixed","content":"**`Builder.UseVersion()` ignored bug** — When `UseVersion(n)` was called, the version value was silently hardcoded to `0` internally. This caused save files to be created at the wrong path when using encryption with versioning."},"14":{"id":"/en/changelog-12","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#fixed","content":"**`SaveData<T>` type parameter shadowing** — A structural bug that allowed serializing a different type than the class-level `T` in `QuickSave<T>`. For example, passing a `string` to a `QuickSave<MyData>` instance compiled without error."},"15":{"id":"/en/changelog-13","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#fixed","content":"**`LoadData()` error distinction** — Previously, a missing file and a corrupted file were handled ambiguously. Now a missing file returns `null`, while a deserialization failure throws `InvalidDataException`, making the two cases clearly distinguishable."},"16":{"id":"/en/changelog-14","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#performance","content":"**Save directory creation optimized** — Previously, `Directory.Exists` was called on every `SaveData`, `LoadData`, and `DeleteData` call. Now the directory is checked and created exactly once at `Build()` time, and the file path is cached in `_filePath`."},"17":{"id":"/en/changelog-15","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added-1","content":"**`DeleteData()`** — Delete the save file (`.acqs`) at runtime. Does not throw if the file doesn't exist."},"18":{"id":"/en/changelog-16","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added-1","content":"**Editor menu `Achieve > Delete Save`** — Unity Editor utility to batch-delete all `.acqs` files in the `quicksave/` directory. Shows a confirmation dialog with the file count and path before deleting."},"19":{"id":"/en/changelog-17","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added-2","content":"Initial package release"},"20":{"id":"/en/changelog-18","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added-2","content":"**`SaveData(T data)`** — Binary serialization using MemoryPack"},"21":{"id":"/en/changelog-19","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added-2","content":"**`LoadData()`** — Binary deserialization and load"},"22":{"id":"/en/changelog-20","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added-2","content":"Save files stored as `.acqs` under `Application.persistentDataPath/quicksave/`"},"23":{"id":"/en/changelog-21","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added-2","content":"**Encryption option** — AES encryption via DataProtector integration (`USE_ENCRYPT` define)"},"24":{"id":"/en/changelog-22","page_id":"/en/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/changelog#added-2","content":"**Version